OL,3,GNEWSAJulie Hesmondhalgh left Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors 'with head held high'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I did feel it was my time," she told
OL,7,FBBC Radio Manchester, adding: "I left
OL,8,Fwith my head held high... but I had
OL,9,Fsome very gratifying apologetic texts
OL,10,Fon Friday night."
